        "title": "Status page freshness tuned to reduce false outages",
        "summary": "Observability probes were retuned so transient snapshot lag and slow model warm-ups stop flipping the public status board.",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Relaxed freshness windows and demoted the published snapshot check to informational so a slow upload no longer marks public surfaces as down, with new policy tests locking in the operational behavior.",
            "commit_shas": [
              "5a0475f59638f66a335b31a10ea9c92a6e06ee49"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "text": "Extended the model-matrix runtime eval timeout to 120s (with matching warning/outage latencies) so cold-start model responses don't read as outages.",
            "commit_shas": [
              "2049590dd90f5d4c09d19b3cd141daa6d0a52c24"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "text": "Tightened the status investigator so it only cites commits and paths that actually appear in the evidence packet, and suppressed weak suspect changes that were producing noisy root-cause guesses.",
            "commit_shas": [
              "7c8e0405beda70cdad1e6f405f3c9c168cde63db",
