        "started_at": "2026-06-16T17:56:04.000Z",
        "ended_at": "2026-06-16T18:08:13.000Z",
        "title": "Chat retries honor the currently selected model",
        "summary": "The chat surface stopped resurrecting unavailable models on retry and now uses whatever model the user actually has selected.",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Retrying a failed turn now sends with the currently selected model instead of the cached model from the failed attempt, so switching away from a broken model actually takes effect.",
            "commit_shas": [
              "fa001c127b0ec77c956560a3cfeed2b7cbbcb723"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "text": "Removed the unavailable Claude Fable chat model and the retired DALL-E 2/3 image models from the picker, with persisted stale selections falling back to gpt-image-2 or gemini-nano-banana.",
            "commit_shas": [
              "45b40a1b6ea09eca5f19adf4f3e9f0cded83de65",
              "0017da2fa7e298c15eaddc462106a0ac5aed6ab9"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "text": "Project API responses now preserve build and test command metadata end-to-end, fixing a round-trip where those fields were being dropped.",
            "commit_shas": [
              "65d4bede047c6dd234d12736dde9515f5d5dede2"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          }
        ]
